    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>护甲（盾牌），非普通（需同调）</em></p><p>你可以用这面魔法盾牌发动远程武器攻击。它具有20尺的通常射程与60尺的最大射程，且它的攻击检定使用你的力量属性或敏捷属性（由你选择）。如果你具有盾牌的熟练项，那么你也将熟练于用这面盾牌发起的攻击检定。命中时，它将造成[[/damage 1d6 type=slashing]]伤害。如果你投掷了盾牌，不论攻击是否命中，它都会在攻击后立刻重新飞回你的手上。</p><p>You can make a ranged weapon attack with this magic shield. It has a normal range of 20 feet and a long range of 60 feet, and it uses your Strength or Dexterity for the attack roll (your choice). If you're proficient with shields, you are proficient with attacks made using this shield. On a hit, it deals [[/damage 1d6 type=slashing]] damage. If you throw the shield, it reappears in your hand the instant after it hits or misses a target.</p>",
